```java
long createProgram() throws Exception — fixed window T0..T0+40, two segments.
long createBatch(String no, long programId)
ResultActions upload(long batchId, String reqId, int[][] points) — points: {offsetMin, temp}
```

Temps as strings? Use int temps for simplicity; JSON numbers fine, BigDecimal parses.

Build readings JSON:

```java
String readingsJson(int[][] points) {
    StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder("[");
    for (...) sb.append("{\"measuredAt\":\"" + T0.plus(m, MINUTES) + "\",\"temperatureC\":" + t + "}");
}
```

Instant.toString gives ISO with Z. Good.

Assertions with jsonPath.

